still have no decent melee weapon.  Grimtooth or Serpent's tongue at +0 
are hardly suited for monsters with 100 Hp.  But at least my magic 
missiles will not hit myself anymore (happened twice, when I decided 
that the danger of a bouncing missile was acceptable, because I was 
